    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">  <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/calculators/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Calculators </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Salary sacrifice</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Free calculator</p>\n<h1 class=\"max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Salary sacrifice calculator</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\">Three numbers decide whether sacrificing is worth it: what your take-home pay drops by, what lands in super, and the gap between them. All three are here.</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft mt-4\"> Updated for 2024–25, 2025–26, 2026–27 · verified against <a href=\"https://www.ato.gov.au/tax-rates-and-codes/tax-rates-australian-residents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ato.gov.au</a> on 2026-08-21 · some 2026–27 thresholds are provisional pending ATO indexation </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-8\">\n<div id=\"xyz-island-0\" data-xyz-island=\"SalarySacrificeCalculator\" data-xyz-props=\"{&quot;defaultFy&quot;:&quot;2026-27&quot;}\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_23rem] lg:gap-12\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-4 sm:px-6\">\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_2l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Your salary</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_2l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"110,000\"/></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Before tax, excluding employer super.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_4l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Sacrifice into super each year</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_4l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"10,000\"/></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">The amount redirected from your pay into super before tax.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_6l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Financial year</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\"><select id=\"_r1R_6l_\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)]\"><option value=\"2024-25\">2024–25</option><option value=\"2025-26\">2025–26</option><option value=\"2026-27\" selected=\"\">2026–27</option></select></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-6 lg:self-start\">\n<div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-paper)]\">Salary sacrifice</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-paper)]/70\">2026–27</span></div>\n<div class=\"tally-print\">\n<div data-tally-line=\"salary\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><span class=\"text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Salary before sacrifice</span><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$110,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"sacrifice\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Less sacrificed to super</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">−</span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$10,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"taxable\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><span class=\"text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Salary you are taxed on</span><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums font-semibold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$100,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"tax-saved\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Income tax and levy saved</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$3,200</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"contributions-tax\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Less 15% contributions tax</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">−</span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$1,500</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"net\" class=\"px-4 py-5\">\n<div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">You are ahead by</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-0.5 max-w-[22rem] text-[0.6875rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$8,500</span> lands in super and your take-home falls by <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$6,800</span>.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-11 shrink-0 items-center\"><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums text-[1.75rem] font-bold text-[var(--color-return)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$1,700</span></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"sr-only\" aria-live=\"polite\">You are ahead by<!-- -->:<!-- --> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,700</span></p>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-2 font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$8,500 into super − $6,800 out of pocket</p>\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\n<div class=\"space-y-3\">\n<div class=\"rounded-[3px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] px-3 py-2.5\">\n<dl class=\"m-0 space-y-1\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between gap-3\">\n<dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Take-home pay falls by</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 font-mono text-[0.8125rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-owing)]\">$6,800</dd>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-between gap-3\">\n<dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Super balance rises by</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 font-mono text-[0.8125rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-return)]\">$8,500</dd>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-between gap-3\">\n<dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Concessional cap used</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 font-mono text-[0.8125rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink)]\">$23,200<!-- --> / <!-- -->$30,000</dd>\n</div>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<p class=\"m-0 text-[0.6875rem] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">An estimate, not financial or tax advice. Division 293 (an extra 15% above <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$250,000</span> of income) and carry-forward cap are not modelled. Money in super is preserved until you meet a condition of release — talk to us before committing to an arrangement.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-testid=\"sticky-result\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 border-t border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white/95 backdrop-blur lg:hidden\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[68rem] items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\">\n<p class=\"m-0 truncate text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">You&#x27;re ahead by</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 font-mono text-lg font-bold tabular-nums text-[var(--color-return)]\">$1,700</p>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 rounded-[4px] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-paper)] no-underline\">Lodge</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"h-20 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p><!--astro:end--></div>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-8\">\n<p class=\"m-0 max-w-2xl text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"> This is an estimate, not tax advice. It works from the figures you enter and the ATO rates for the year you selected; your actual assessment is determined by the ATO and may differ. We never ask for your tax file number on this site. </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"prose-statement\">\n<h2>The trade, in one line</h2>\n<p> You give up income taxed at your marginal rate and receive it in super taxed at  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">15%</span>. The whole benefit is the gap between those two rates, so it grows with your income and disappears near the bottom of the scale. </p>\n<p> At the 30% bracket the gap is 17c in the dollar once the Medicare levy is counted. At 45% it is 32c. At 15% or 16% there is essentially nothing in it, and the money is locked away for decades — which is a real cost, not a footnote. </p>\n<h2>The cap includes your employer&#8217;s contributions</h2>\n<p> This is where people get caught. On a  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$150,000</span> salary, employer super at  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">12%</span> is already <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$18,000</span> of the  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$30,000</span> cap. Sacrificing another  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$15,000</span> puts you over, and the excess is taxed at your marginal rate anyway plus an interest charge. The panel above tracks the cap as you type. </p>\n<p> If your total super balance was under <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$500,000</span> at the previous 30 June, you can use unused cap from the past five years — which is how someone with a windfall or a capital gain can make a large contribution in a single year without breaching anything. </p>\n<h2>Before you set it up</h2>\n<p> A sacrifice arrangement must be agreed with your employer <em>before</em> you earn the income; you cannot apply it retrospectively to money you have already been paid. Check that your employer calculates its super guarantee on your pre-sacrifice salary — since 2020 it must, but payroll systems still get it wrong. </p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-salary-sacrifice-calculator-heading\">\n<h2 id=\"faq-salary-sacrifice-calculator-heading\" class=\"text-2xl\">Questions people actually ask</h2>\n<dl class=\"mt-6 border-t border-rule\">\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">How does salary sacrificing into super save tax?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">Money sacrificed is taken before tax, so instead of being taxed at your marginal rate it is taxed at 15% going into super. If your marginal rate is 30% plus the 2% levy, you save 17c in the dollar.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">How much can I salary sacrifice?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">The concessional cap is <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$30,000</span> a year and it includes your employer&#39;s contributions, not just yours. Going over means the excess is taxed at your marginal rate, which removes the benefit entirely — unless you have unused cap carried forward from the last five years.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Is salary sacrifice worth it on a low income?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">Less so. If your marginal rate is 15% or 16%, the 15% contributions tax leaves almost nothing on the table, and the money is locked up until preservation age. Below about <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$45,000</span> the government co-contribution for after-tax contributions is usually the better route.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Does salary sacrifice reduce my HECS repayment?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">No. Sacrificed super is added back when the ATO works out your repayment income, so your compulsory HECS repayment is unchanged. It is one of the more common misconceptions.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Can I sacrifice things other than super?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">Yes — a novated car lease, a work laptop, professional memberships. Non-super sacrifice generally creates a reportable fringe benefit, which counts towards the Medicare levy surcharge, HECS repayments and family assistance tests even though it is not taxable income.</dd>\n</p></div>\n</dl>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl\">Read up first</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 grid list-none gap-4 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n<li class=\"card p-5\">\n<h3 class=\"text-base\"><a href=\"/tax-tips/standard-deduction-1000/\" class=\"text-ink no-underline hover:underline\">The <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,000</span> standard deduction: what it is and who it helps</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">From 1 July 2026 every Australian taxpayer can claim <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,000</span> of work-related expenses without receipts. Here is how it works and when itemising still beats it.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"cta-dark\">\n<div class=\"cta-grid\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Ready to lodge it?</p>\n<h2>A registered agent prepares it, checks it, and lodges it.</h2>\n<p>Most refunds land within two weeks of assessment. The fee is fixed and quoted before we start — nothing is charged until you approve the finished return.</p>\n<div class=\"cta-actions\"> <a href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"btn\">Start your return</a> <a href=\"/services/pricing/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">See pricing</a> </div>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec\">\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Individual returns from</span><b>$99</b></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Tax Practitioners Board</span><b>Registered Tax Agent</b></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fixed fee, quoted up front</span><i>included</i></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fee taken from your refund</span><b>$44</b></div>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl\">Other calculators</h2>\n<p> <a href=\"/calculators/\" class=\"text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">All calculators →</a> </div>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 grid list-none gap-4 p-0 sm:grid-cols-3\">\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/tax-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Income tax </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Your tax, Medicare levy, study loan repayment and take-home pay for any income, in any of the last three financial years.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/tax-refund-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Tax refund </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Estimate your refund by adding the deductions you actually have. Watch the number move as you claim.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/calculators/capital-gains-tax-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Capital gains </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">What you will pay on a share, property or crypto sale — with the 50% discount and any carried-forward losses applied in the right order.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<p><script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/brseeger-cloud/xyz-accounting-assets@main/islands/SalarySacrificeCalculator.js\" defer></script></p>\n"
